  "id": "persian-cucumber-yogurt",
  "name": "Persian Cucumber Yogurt",
  "subtitle": "Cool, herbed yogurt dip with crisp cucumber",
  "description": "A refreshing yogurt dip mixed with diced Persian cucumbers, garlic, shallot, dill, salt, and pepper, then chilled so the flavors meld.",
